title: A guest that has a folder of its own open joins and leaves: its folder stays, is not shared, and its unsaved text is still asked about on closing
folders: share-text
fixtures: share-second
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-file: share-second\second.txt :: ^own-text\.second one\nsecond two\n$
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: ^line 01\nline 02\n
guest-expect-log: opening .*fix.share-second
guest-expect-log: opening .*shared.*share-text

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 14000
fit
wait 1500
mark host-with-guest
wait 12000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 1000
workspace put {FIX}\share-second
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4000
tab 1
wait 800
edit second.txt 1 1
type own-text.
wait 800
fit
wait 1500
mark both-folders
wait 500
tab 2
wait 800
edit notes.txt 2 1
type shared-not-saved.
wait 1500
share stop
wait 2000
fit
wait 1500
mark after-leaving
wait 500
quit
wait 1200
mark asked-about-own-file
wait 600
answer Save and close
wait 1500
